{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17371190","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17371190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1737119001:1":{"text":"传说自神圣升华之后，罗兰大帝的英灵，其实一直寄宿在这座高大华丽的雕像里。","source_cn":"传说自神圣升华之后，罗兰大帝的英灵，其实一直寄宿在这座...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94A963A4C870F6B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1737119002:1":{"text":"他日夜俯瞰着这座城市，看着那些寒冷、饥饿、生病的人们，看着那些世间不为人知的苦难，却无法移动分毫。","source_cn":"他日夜俯瞰着这座城市，看着那些寒冷、饥饿、生病的人们，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79095FC04722D2DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1737119003:1":{"text":"直到有一天，一只迷路的小狐狸跑到了雕像脚下，成了罗兰大帝的朋友。","source_cn":"直到有一天，一只迷路的小狐狸跑到了雕像脚下，成了罗兰大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80291B8B259596C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1737119004:1":{"text":"对世人心生怜悯的罗兰大帝让小狐狸把他身上的金箔一片片剥下来，把他剑柄上的宝石一颗颗抠下来，送给那些需要帮助的穷人。","source_cn":"对世人心生怜悯的罗兰大帝让小狐狸把他身上的金箔一片片剥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3189A58D1D59EAC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1737119005:1":{"text":"哇……怪不得这座雕像没有全身都覆盖着金箔，原来是因为这个！","source_cn":"哇……怪不得这座雕像没有全身都覆盖着金箔，原来是因为这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF09236483EBE38B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_reco